rtifact_files() and _detect_artifact_type(). Must handle orphan detection result set after triage-orphans runs.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_dh_migrate.py` \u2014 Unit tests for dh_migrate CLI. Must add tests for triage-orphans (interactive/batch modes, K/D/S persistence) and synthesize-architecture (triage-log merging, dedup, deletion).\\n\\n### Code \u2014 Other References\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/artifact_registry.py::ArtifactRegistry` \u2014 Reads artifact entries from GitHub Issue bodies. synthesize-architecture may need to read registered paths for orphan exclusion.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/models.py::ArtifactStatus` \u2014 Enum defining lifecycle stages. May need KEEP/DELETE states if triage decisions are persisted beyond JSON log.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/scripts/dh_migrate.py::_ARTIFACT_TYPE_PATTERNS` \u2014 Used for negative matching to detect orphans.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/scripts/dh_migrate.py::_SKIP_PREFIXES` \u2014 Must be respected by triage-orphans to avoid flagging backup/temp files.\\n\\n### Documentation (will become stale)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/scripts/dh_migrate.py` docstring (lines 14\u201328) \u2014 Lists current commands and usage. Must be updated to document new subcommands.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/docs/backend-providers.md` \u2014 Describes artifact workflows. Will become stale if triage/synthesize changes the expected flow.\\n\\n### Configuration / CI\\n- `pyproject.toml` \u2014 Script linting/type-check rules. No changes expected, but new code must pass existing checks.\\n- `.github/workflows/*.yml` \u2014 May invoke register-artifacts in CI. May need triage step added as prerequisite.\\n\\n### Agent Instructions (instruct AI to use current interface)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/*.md` \u2014 Any agent referencing dh_migrate artifact commands may become stale.\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/*/SKILL.md` \u2014 Skills referencing artifact migration steps.\\n\\n### Systems Inventory\\n| System | Role | Connection | Impact |\\n|--------|------|-----------|--------|\\n| dh_migrate.py | Command dispatcher | Core script being extended | HIGH |\\n| _collect_artifact_files() | Artifact discovery | Needs orphan detection variant | HIGH |\\n| test_dh_migrate.py | Test suite | Must cover new commands | HIGH |\\n| artifact_registry.py | Manifest CRUD | Read for orphan exclusion | MEDIUM |\\n| migrate_plan_artifacts.py | Batch registration | Calls discovery helpers | MEDIUM |\\n| models.py | Type definitions | May need triage status enum | MEDIUM |\\n| dh_migrate.py docstring | Documentation | Lists commands | LOW |\\n| backend-providers.md | Architecture doc | Describes artifact workflows | LOW |\\n\\n### Ecosystem Completeness Checklist\\n- [ ] triage-orphans command implemented (interactive + --batch + --type filter)\\n- [ ] synthesize-architecture command implemented (merge, dedup, delete)\\n- [ ] Triage log schema implemented as JSON ({path, decision, decided_at})\\n- [ ] _collect_artifact_files() extended or new helper for orphan discovery\\n- [ ] test_dh_migrate.py extended with new command test cases\\n- [ ] dh_migrate.py docstring updated\\n- [ ] Type annotations verified for new types (TriageDecision, TriageLog)\\n- [ ] Interactive K/D/S prompt handles no-TTY environment (script or tmux per CLAUDE.md)\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-03-24T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **orphan plan artifact triage and architecture synthesis in dh_migrate.py** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Not specified\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-24\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-03-24)\\n\\n## Scope Of Changes\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-03-24T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- `dh_migrate.py`: add `triage-orphans` and `synthesize-architecture` subcommands\\n- Triage log schema: `{path: str, decision: \\\"keep\\\"|\\\"delete\\\"|\\\"skip\\\", decided_at: str}`\\n- Orphan discovery logic: glob all plan artifact files, subtract registered artifact paths from all manifests\\n- Heading deduplication: parse `## Heading` lines, keep last-modified version of each section\\n</div>\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Unmatched artifacts are a mix of stale snapshots and genuine architectural decisions worth preserving\\n- No tooling exists to inspect them at scale \u2014 manual review of 106 files is impractical\\n- Deleting blindly risks losing context that has no other copy\\n</div>\\n\\n## Desired Behaviour\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-03-24T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n### Command 1: `dh_migrate.py triage-orphans`\\n\\n- Discovers all plan artifact files not registered in any backlog item manifest\\n- For each file, prints:\\n  ```\\n  plan/architect-plugin-lifecycle.md [type: architect | last modified: 2026-01-14]\\n  \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n  <first 1024 chars of file content>\\n  \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n  [K]eep  [D]elete  [S]kip >\\n  ```\\n- Records Keep/Delete decisions to a triage log file (e.g., ~/.dh/projects/{slug}/plan/triage-log.json) so the session can be interrupted and resumed\\n- `--batch` flag: non-interactive \u2014 dumps all as the preview format to stdout for piping/review without prompting\\n- `--type <type>` filter: limit to `architect`, `codebase`, `feature-context`, etc.\\n\\n### Command 2: `dh_migrate.py synthesize-architecture`\\n\\n- Reads triage log, collects all files marked K (Keep)\\n- Merges them into ~/.dh/projects/{slug}/plan/master-architecture.md\\n- Deduplicates by heading \u2014 most recent file wins on conflict\\n- Appends a provenance section listing source files and their modification dates\\n- Deletes all files marked D (Delete) after confirming the synthesis file was written successfully\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"a2b02dadcc949714e195b659d9bedeb932f53d2a7aee0517268e7db7ce112429\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPt4U3Q\"}"}